StoryNow Builder Mode Patch\par
\par
This package creates the empty data\\builder\\builder marker in a detected
Steam installation folder named SN. Windows Installer also records per-user
installation state. It makes no network requests and installs no background
services.\par
\par
Use this patch only on a StoryNow installation that you own or are authorized
to modify.\par
